onas from PersonaHub, samples for diversity, and generates text across multiple LLMs and target identity groups."}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"overview-findings","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Data construction:"}]," 2,285 selected personas, 8 generators, and 34 identity groups produce"," ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"791,283 valid samples"}],". Six judges annotate the outputs; group- and label-balanced sampling yields"," ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"67,452 training examples"}],"."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Detector evaluation:"}]," DeBERTa-v3 reaches"," ","$L13"," across four external benchmarks. Fine-tuning Llama-3.1-8B improves average F1 from"," ","$L14","."," ","$L15"]}],"$L16"]}],"$L17"]}],"$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c"]}],"$L1d"]
